            "detailed_description": "After the death of your child, you decided to leave his hometown to make a new life in a small village, in the travel your cart is stolen and you need to start your life empty-handed.<br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Progress your character taking care of your 7 needs:hunger, thirst, toilet, hygiene, sleep, happiness and health.<br></li><li>Crafting mechanics<br></li><li>Shop System.<br></li><li>Bank System.<br></li><li>Quest System.<br></li><li>Mining and refining of ores.<br></li><li>Food cooking.<br></li><li>World day-night cycle.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future features:</h2></strong><br><br></li><li>5 more races to play: dwarf, white elf, Shadow elf, demon, undead.<br></li><li>1 new scourge village to upgrade.<br></li><li>FriendShip System.<br></li><li>Farms plots around the world to grow your crops.<br></li><li>Ranged combat  with bows and magic staffs.<br></li><li>New lands to explore with biomes snow and desert.<br></li><li>Housing.<br></li><li>Gods to worship for each race with unique buffs.<br></li><li>More to come!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708910/extras/e81a876df2b324b2c0150d106724aa92.webp?t=1543835515\" width=135 height=20 /></span></li></ul>",
